{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15424","headline":"喜皇甫郎中拜谕德兼集贤学士 · 李端","name":"喜皇甫郎中拜谕德兼集贤学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲郎三载後，宠命一朝新。\n望苑迁词客，儒林拜丈人。\n莺飞绮阁曙，柳拂画堂春。\n几日调金鼎，诸君欲望尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}